# Unlock features

When adding or changing an unlock, follow `.cursor/skills/add-unlock-feature/SKILL.md`.

Source of truth: json-rules-engine milestone rules → `MILESTONE_SCHEDULE` prizes → `resolveGrantedPrizes` / `UNLOCK_FEATURE_CATALOG`. Do not gate media or Options with `if (milestoneId === "…")` in components.
